<BaseLayout title="Privacy | PumpOS" description="Privacy information and contact details for the PumpOS pilot." path="/legal/privacy" noindex><article class="reading-page"><p class="section-context">PumpOS pilot</p><h1>Privacy information</h1><div class="legal-notice">The full privacy policy is being prepared for launch. This page is not a final privacy policy.</div><div class="prose-pump"><h2>Contacting us</h2><p>If you email us to arrange a demo, share your name, station name and preferred contact details. Customer records and financial files are not needed for the demonstration.</p><h2>Your station's information</h2><p>PumpOS separates organizations' operational data. We will discuss access and onboarding requirements before your station joins the pilot.</p><h2>Privacy questions</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared with us, email <a href="mailto:hello@pumpos.app?subject=Privacy%20question">hello@pumpos.app</a>.</p></div></article></BaseLayout>
